{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/842654-i-m-looking-for-a-storyteller-to-do-a-1-on-1-with-me","id":842654,"title":"I'm looking for a storyteller to do a 1-on-1 with me","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-05T11:18:36-08:00","id":842654,"title":"I'm looking for a storyteller to do a 1-on-1 with me","content":"I'm looking for a storyteller to do a 1-on-1 with me. Can anybody help me out? Because the character that I have is a ronin garou. I want to take him on an adventure that will redeem him and allow him to enter back into garou society with his head held high. I've tried to introduce him into other games, but either nobody will allow a ronin or it's just too disruptive to the sept to play him correctly with all the self-loathing and angst. I'm just looking for a storyteller. What do you think would be a good way for redemption? Let me give you a little background. His sept was wiped out by a bane while he hid like a coward. It was on the night of his Rite of Passage. He had gone into a sweat lodge for a visionquest. He traveled through the penumbra. When he was finished with his assignment he returned to his body. That was when the nihilach attacked. It had followed my character back to the caern and it laid waste to the entire sept. He only escaped because as soon as the battle started he was able to hide until the thing was gone. That's why he's a ronin. There is no way he could survive going after and killing the nihilach. Probably not even if he had an army. So he needs to have another opportunity. Something that will be as equal. What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3147-bones","name":"Bones","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3147_2